<title>SINGAPORE: Pacific Andes 1st-half net rises 22.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Pacific Andes 1st-half net rises 22.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in millions of HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 28.09     vs    22.91</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		22.93     vs    18.70</p>
<p>    Turnover			  448.78     vs   354.07</p>
<p>    Interest income		  12.87     vs     3.50</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)	     29.09     vs    18.57</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	  1.62     vs     1.16</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   28.59     vs    23.91</p>
<p>    Tax				   0.50     vs     1.00</p>
<p>Note - Singapore-listed Pacific Andes (Holdings) Ltd is a Hong Kong-based frozen seafood company owned by Hong Kong's Pacific Andes International Holdings. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
